@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Catalog - Create Product

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Seller|
start
note right
Precondition:
The seller is signed in and approved.

Postcondition:
The product exists and belongs to the seller in the
token. The product is found by meaning within 10 minutes
(embedding sync job).
end note
:Open the product form;
|System|
:Display the form and categories;
|Seller|
repeat
:Enter name, description, price, stock, category and choose an image;
:Submit the product;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Seller|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check price above 0, stock not negative, the category exists, a listed product has an image and the image is on the project's Cloudinary;
backward :Return the validation error;
repeat while (The data is invalid?) is (Yes) not (No)
:Save the product and return the result;
|Seller|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
